<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .line-item-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  .line-item-table td { padding: 5px 0; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="University Logo" style="height: 60px;"/>
      <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 10px;">NORTHERN MICHIGAN UNIVERSITY</h1>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 16pt;">NMU Truck Driving School</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Provider #: <span data-field="provider_number">{{ provider_number }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    To Register: Complete the following form. Email to: <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>, fax to: (906) 227-2108, or mail to: <span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span>.
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    Questions: Call Continuing Education & Workforce Development (906) 227-2103.
  </p>

  <div style="width: 100%;">
    <div class="form-group" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Last Name:</label>
      <div style="width: 60%;">
        <span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">First Name:</label>
      <div style="width: 60%;">
        <span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Middle Initial:</label>
      <div style="width: 60%;">
        <span data-field="middle_initial">{{ middle_initial }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Company Name:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Address:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">City:</label>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
      </div>
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">State:</label>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
      </div>
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Zip:</label>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Phone:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">E-mail:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Driver's License #:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="driver_license_number">{{ driver_license_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Course Session:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="course_session">{{ course_session }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label style="font-weight: bold;">Course Date:</label>
      <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="course_date">{{ course_date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <div style="border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; width: 45%; text-align: center;">Yes, I need a payment plan:</span>
        <span style="display: inline-block; width: 45%; text-align: center;">No, I don't need a payment plan:</span>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; width: 45%; text-align: center;">Yes, I need Financial Assistance:</span>
        <span style="display: inline-block; width: 45%; text-align: center;">No, I don't need Financial Assistance:</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">
      <p>
        The total cost of this program is <span data-field="total_cost">{{ total_cost }}</span>, which includes the course and the use of an NMU tractor-trailer for one State of Michigan CDL driver license test. This does not include DOT physical examination, drug screen, basic TIP fee or the 3rd party tester fee. The student is also responsible for the license fee, any endorsements beyond the basic CDL-A minimum requirements, and all costs associated with subsequent CDL driver license tests. The cost of the textbook (can be purchased separately), log-book & green book is $50 (to be paid by the first day of class). A non-refundable deposit of $500 is required when the Student Contract is signed. Full payment must be received at least one week prior to the first day of class and can be made by cash, money order or credit card.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>